# FACTS — agent rules
- Stack: Express + PostgreSQL (Neon) + vanilla JS in /public
- NEVER add routes to server.js — new features go in modules/
- Module pattern: modules/mod_*/index.js exports routes, healthCheck, metadata
- DB migrations: modules/mod_*/migrations/{timestamp}_{name}.js
- Read MODULES.md for module registry; read CLAUDE.md for schema/tables
- Frontend: static HTML in public/ — no build step
